  "rows": {
    "UP-ISSUE-1870": "| [UP-ISSUE-1870](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/issues/1870) | feat: add an upstream facet to dashboard request logs | РЕШЕНО | ИСПРАВЛЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §99: observed upstream OR/AND facet, stable/deleted IDs, source/self/status filters, exact counts/cache и URL/reset/badges; canonical/slash + SQLite/backend/browser PASS. PG/MySQL plans/live/cloud отдельно. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-observability-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-PR-2146": "| [UP-PR-2146](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/pull/2146) | PR #2146: feat(dashboard): add request heatmap on dashboard | Раздел 12, L1402 | ИСПРАВЛЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §99: six-month UTC rollup+raw-tail endpoint и optional local Appearance heatmap; warmup exclusion, server calendar, loading/retry, mode persistence/query gating и 375/768/1440 browser PASS. PG/MySQL/live/cloud отдельно. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-observability-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-DISC-378": "| [UP-DISC-378](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/discussions/378) | #378: Deeper usage analysis | Раздел 11, L1339 | ИСПРАВЛЕНО ЛОКАЛЬНО / ЧАСТИЧНО ПРОВЕРЕНО | §99: offline JSONL/gzip/SSE tool-call/results CLI, session/request dedup, explicit error/success/unknown и privacy subprocess PASS. Автоматическая оценка качества модели, per-tool tokens и dashboard analytics остаются открыты; default correlation request-scoped без session metadata. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-observability-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-DISC-1894": "| [UP-DISC-1894](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/discussions/1894) | #1894: Why is the reporting so SLOW? | Раздел 11, L1198 | ПРОВЕРЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §99: existing report rollup/cache, coalescing/cancellation, long-window speed omission и 30000-row real API/raw-retention parity PASS; local probe ~0.389s→0.072s. Исторический production slowdown/live/server DB этим не закрывается. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-observability-contracts/verification.md). |",
    "UP-DISC-292": "| [UP-DISC-292](https://github.com/Soju06/codex-lb/discussions/292) | #292: Request log retention: auto-clearing and configuration options | Раздел 11, L1308 | ПРОВЕРЕНО / ЗАКРЫТО ЛОКАЛЬНО | §99: retention default off, tri-state/floors/settings, runtime leader tick/no restart, bounded pruning/folded aggregate preservation PASS; operator docs added. Production deletion не выполнялась; archive policy отдельно. [Verification](openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-14-repair-five-observability-contracts/verification.md). |"
  },
